### Affected Resource(s)

* aws_backup_plan

### Expected Behavior

Lifecycle rule defined in backup rule should be used when not explicitly defined in _copy_action_ ("Use the same settings from backup rule").

### Actual Behavior

When _copy_action_ is used without _lifecycle_ definition, in AWS console you can see that "Custom lifeycle" is chosen and "Total retention period" settings are empty in the "Copy to destination - optional)" section and "Total retention (years)" is at "10+" which could result in high backup storage cost if not noticed.

